From: pattex67 <33281022+pattex67@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 00:34:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] Ampere lowering: ALD in a geometry program's exit
 envelope body (Yoshi)

The exit setup analysis did not know ALD, so a Yoshi and the Mysterious Book geometry program was
rejected ("native instruction before exit setup state is dead").

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/shader_recompiler/frontend/ampere/geometry_exit.h | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/shader_recompiler/frontend/ampere/geometry_exit.h b/src/shader_recompiler/frontend/ampere/geometry_exit.h
index c3c21afbdf..14e2224925 100644
--- a/src/shader_recompiler/frontend/ampere/geometry_exit.h
+++ b/src/shader_recompiler/frontend/ampere/geometry_exit.h
@@ -171,6 +171,13 @@ GeometryExitEnvelope AnalyzeGeometryExit(const Code& code) {
             read_sources(true);
             write_register(bits(index, 16, 8));
             write_predicate(bits(index, 81, 3));
+        } else if (opcode == 0x321) {
+            // ALD Rd.. (1-4 components, bits 74-75), [Ra], Rb: loads attributes of the vertex in
+            // operand b (Yoshi and the Mysterious Book's geometry programs).
+            read_register(bits(index, 24, 8));
+            read_register(bits(index, 32, 8));
+            const u32 components = bits(index, 74, 2) + 1;
+            for (u32 i = 0; i < components; ++i) write_register(bits(index, 16, 8) + i);
         } else if (opcode == 0x322) {
             // AST: stores 1-4 components from operand b for the vertex in c; writes nothing.
             const u32 value = bits(index, 32, 8), components = bits(index, 74, 2) + 1;
